{"assets":["/statement-assets/52b55dea0481024440bcb512de078b765b87f54003f87d9dfc0ed40cdae0cf7a.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1797","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Li Hua and Maze"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a rectangular maze of size $$$n\\times m$$$. Denote $$$(r,c)$$$ as the cell on the $$$r$$$-th row from the top and the $$$c$$$-th column from the left. Two cells are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"adjacent"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if they share an edge. A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"path"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a sequence of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"adjacent"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" empty cells."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each cell is initially empty. Li Hua can choose some cells (except $$$(x_1, y_1)$$$ and $$$(x_2, y_2)$$$) and place an obstacle in each of them. He wants to know the minimum number of obstacles needed to be placed so that there isn't a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"path"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" from $$$(x_1, y_1)$$$ to $$$(x_2, y_2)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suppose you were Li Hua, please solve this problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 500$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n,m$$$ ($$$4\\le n,m\\le 10^9$$$) — the size of the maze."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains four integers $$$x_1,y_1,x_2,y_2$$$ ($$$1\\le x_1,x_2\\le n, 1\\le y_1,y_2\\le m$$$) — the coordinates of the start and the end."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that $$$|x_1-x_2|+|y_1-y_2|\\ge 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case print the minimum number of obstacles you need to put on the field so that there is no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"path"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" from $$$(x_1, y_1)$$$ to $$$(x_2, y_2)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n4 4\n2 2 3 3\n6 7\n1 1 2 3\n9 9\n5 1 3 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n2\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In test case 1, you can put obstacles on $$$(1,3), (2,3), (3,2), (4,2)$$$. Then the path from $$$(2,2)$$$ to $$$(3,3)$$$ will not exist."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/52b55dea0481024440bcb512de078b765b87f54003f87d9dfc0ed40cdae0cf7a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1797A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1797/problem/A"}